  "title": "Voyager Awarded Raytheon Contract Supporting SM-3",
  "summary": "Company’s throttleable propulsion tech advancing SM-3 and next-generation interceptor DENVER--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- Voyager Technologies (NYSE: VOYG) has been awarded a contract by Raytheon, an RTX business, to advance propulsion technologies for the Standard Missile-3 (SM-3®) interceptor family. The company will provide its solid controllable throttleable propulsion technology and divert, attitude and…",
